flowchart LR
  N[Each physical worker can host 1..N isolated sessions<br/>Disjoint file and resource ownership]
  C[Orchestrator contract<br/>Interfaces · base SHA<br/>Timebox · acceptance]
  A[Worker 1<br/>Owns API files + tests<br/>Isolated checkout A]
  B[Worker 2<br/>Owns UI files + tests<br/>Isolated checkout B]
  D[Worker 3<br/>Owns adapter files + tests<br/>Isolated checkout C]
  R[Orchestrator review gate<br/>Diff + logs + exits<br/>Verified process closure<br/>Orchestrator decides]
  I[Serial integration<br/>Shared checkout · default branch<br/>GPU · VM · service · device gate]
  E[Optional advisor · e.g. Fable 5.2<br/>Read-only; owns no files or resources<br/>No edits, dispatch, or integration]
  T[User requests plan review<br/>OR worker AND orchestrator cannot solve]
  N -.-> A
  N -.-> B
  N -.-> D
  C --> A
  C --> B
  C --> D
  A --> R
  B --> R
  D --> R
  R --> I
  R -.->|Focused brief + evidence| E
  E -.->|Advice to verify; never direct worker instructions| R
  T -.- E
  classDef root fill:#eaf0ff,stroke:#4261b9,color:#172644
  classDef worker fill:#e9f7f4,stroke:#208c80,color:#153e39
  classDef gate fill:#f3edfb,stroke:#8c68b3,color:#423050
  classDef advisor fill:#fff3db,stroke:#ad7420,color:#63430f
  class C,R root
  class A,B,D worker
  class I gate
  class E,T advisor
